"Pre Provision can be used for a Blueprint so it is added before a script "
"which is set at the Provision phase executes. Pre Provision for scripts "
"is mainly for Docker as you can execute on the host before the container "
"is running."
msgstr "Pre Provision peut ser used for a Blueprint so it is added before a script which is set at the Provision phase executes. Pre Provision for scripts is mainly for Docker as you can execute on the host before the container is running."

