msgid "Provision"
msgstr "Aprovisionar"

#: ../../library/automation/workflows.rst:37
msgid ""
"Like pre-provision, Tasks for VMs are run after the VM is running. For "
"containers, these Tasks are run on the containers once they are running "
"on the host. For many users, this is the most commonly-used phase."
msgstr "Like pre-provision, Tasks for VMs are run after the VM is running. For containers, these Tasks are run on the containers once they are running on the host. For many users, this is the most commonly-used phase."

